.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-attestation-cert 1  "oct-attestation-cert " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-attestation\-cert \- Print the card\*(Aqs attestation certificate
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct attestation cert\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-card\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Print the card\*(Aqs attestation certificate
.PP
New YubiKeys are preloaded with an attestation certificate issued by the Yubico CA.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-card\fR \fI<card ident>\fR
Identifier of the card to use
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
